       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks like an error. Metformin 4250 mg three times daily comes to 12,750 mg/day. The usual maximum is 2,550 mg/day (about 850 mg three times daily), and a single dose is typically 500\u20131,000 mg. At this dose, the risk of lactic acidosis is serious.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **850 mg** PO three times daily with meals (2,550 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **425 mg** PO three times daily\n- **500 mg** or **1000 mg** PO with meals, at a different frequency\n\nTell me the dose you intend and I'll enter it right away. If 4250 mg really is what you want, please confirm that and I'll note the rationale on the order."
